app ui-uncontrolled-battle-board "1.0.0"
"UncontrolledBattleBoard — autonomous auto-battler: units seek and fight to the last side standing while the player spectates."
;; @capabilities "autonomous auto-battler, AI unit combat, spectator gameplay, last-side-standing win condition"

;; ============================================================================
;; PERSONA + USER STORIES
;;
;; Read these before changing anything here, and walk them end to end after.
;; One persona: the SPECTATOR. This is an auto-battler — you do not command
;; units, you watch two AI sides fight it out on a 5x5 isometric board.
;; Statuses verified 2026-07-31 (gate-4 catalog playthrough, post-deploy):
;; standalone playground + Playwright against the compiled .orb, polling the
;; __orbitalVerification bridge (getLastDrawables / assetStatus / eventLog /
;; getTransitions) and the HUD DOM over three full battles plus a Play Again
;; re-run; one screenshot per story under
;; docs/runtime-verification-screenshots/gate4-ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/.
;; All 34 board svg URLs return 200 on the CDN; assetStatus reports loaded /
;; 0 failed and each run saw zero failed requests. This pass fixed the
;; end-of-battle overlay (story 8): the tick emitted GAME_END before its own
;; render-ui, and the tick's deferred slot write landed after the
;; transition's overlay render and erased it.
;;
;; THE GENRE (what an auto-battler spectator expects): the fight is the show.
;; You set the stage and the battle runs itself — both sides seek each other
;; without orders, clash when adjacent, trade blows until one side is wiped.
;; The pleasure is reading the board: who is closing, who is winning the
;; trade, whose bar is shrinking. A round looks like: every 2s — every unit
;; drops back to its idle breathing -> engaged units (enemy adjacent) raise
;; their attack -> each engaged pair trades a hit (target flashes its hit
;; frame, its health bar shrinks, a slash fx pops at the stricken unit and
;; fades) -> every unengaged unit steps 1 cell toward the nearest living
;; enemy -> the Round counter ticks. When one side has no living units the
;; battle ends: VICTORY if the allies stand, DEFEAT if the enemies do, and
;; the board freezes behind the overlay. There is no player input by design —
;; tile/unit clicks are inert; the only buttons are the ones that start the
;; battle over.
;; ============================================================================
;;
;; SPECTATOR — "I watch the battle unfold and root for my side."
;;
;;   1. I open the board and the whole battlefield is framed on screen —
;;      full-cell isometric terrain under every cell, barrels/chest features
;;      on the flanks, both units with a name label and a health bar, and
;;      the HUD reading Round / Allies / Enemies.
;;        WORKS. Boot probe at Round 1: HUD DOM reads Round 1 / Allies 1 /
;;        Enemies 1, the draw list carries 25 tile sprites + 2 ground-anchored
;;        features (barrels/chest) + 2 unit sprites + 2 name labels (Mender /
;;        Shadow Legion) + per-unit black backing and full green hp bar
;;        (width 0.8). All art 200s; zero failed requests. story-1 shot.
;;   2. The battle starts on its own — I never issue an order.
;;        WORKS. Three observed battles ran start to finish with zero input
;;        (no sendEvent, no clicks): Round 1 -> 5 in ~10.5s on autoBattleTick
;;        (2s, guarded on result == "none" AND both sides alive); no
;;        transition listens to TILE_CLICK / UNIT_CLICK — spectator by design.
;;   3. Unengaged units breathe in place (4-frame idle, feet-anchored).
;;        WORKS. The first step of every battle round resets living units to
;;        "idle"; across the 100ms renderTick the draw-list unit URLs cycled
;;        mender.idle-0/1/2/3 and shadow.idle-0..3 (frame = floor(f/3) % 4;
;;        all four idle svgs 200 on the CDN). story-3 shot.
;;   4. Units seek each other without orders — every round, every unit with
;;      no adjacent enemy steps 1 cell toward the nearest living enemy.
;;        WORKS (enemy seek live; ally seek symmetric but unexercised).
;;        Shadow Legion painted walk frames (shadow.walk-0/walk-1) and
;;        converged (3,2) -> (2,2), distance 2 -> 1, with no input. In the
;;        default 1v1 the ally never needs to step: the enemy seek step runs
;;        first each tick and reaches adjacency immediately, so the mirrored
;;        player-seek branch is present but not exercised by this roster.
;;        story-4 shot.
;;   5. Adjacent enemies trade blows automatically — attack frame on the
;;      attacker, hit frame on the target, the health bar shrinks, and a
;;      slash fx pops at the stricken unit then fades.
;;        WORKS with one honest caveat. At contact both units painted hit-0,
;;        the green hp widths stepped 0.8 -> 0.64/0.53 -> 0.32/0, and the
;;        slash fx sprite popped at the stricken unit then faded while the
;;        battle kept playing (fx layer observed non-empty then empty
;;        mid-battle; renderTick decays ttl -1/100ms). Caveat: attack-0 never
;;        reached the draw list — in the mirrored 1v1 every engaged unit is
;;        simultaneously attacker and target, and the damage step overwrites
;;        the attack raise with hit/death in the same tick. story-5 shot.
;;   6. A unit reduced to 0 hp dies — death frame, empty bar, and it stops
;;      seeking and fighting.
;;        WORKS. Kill round: shadow.death-0 painted, Enemies 1 -> 0 on the
;;        HUD, hp bar 0; the corpse's position froze and the battle ended
;;        the same tick. All combat/seek steps guard on hp > 0. story-6 shot.
;;   7. The HUD tracks the battle live — Round increments and the Allies /
;;      Enemies counts drop as units fall.
;;        WORKS. HUD DOM tracked live across probes: Round 1 -> 3 -> 5,
;;        Allies 1 throughout, Enemies 1 -> 0 on the kill round. story-7 shot.
;;   8. When one side is wiped the battle ends — VICTORY if the allies
;;      stand, DEFEAT otherwise — and the board freezes behind the overlay.
;;        WORKS (fixed this gate). GAME_END is in the eventLog and the
;;        transition trace (playing -> complete, guard pass); the VICTORY /
;;        "Battle complete" game-menu overlay renders with two Play Again
;;        buttons; the board freezes — identical drawables 1.5s apart and
;;        zero tick activity after GAME_END in the runtime log. Pre-fix the
;;        tick emitted GAME_END before its own render-ui, and the tick's
;;        deferred slot write landed after the transition's overlay render
;;        so the overlay never painted; now the tick render-ui is gated on
;;        result == "none" and the emit runs last. story-8 shot.
;;   9. I press Play Again and the battle resets and runs again.
;;        WORKS. Play Again click -> playing with Round reset, both hp bars
;;        full (0.8), units re-seeded idle-0 at (1,2)/(3,2); the second
;;        battle ran to complete + VICTORY again with no input. story-9 shot.
;; ============================================================================

orbital UncontrolledBattleBoardOrbital {

  type UncontrolledBattleBoardError = {
    message : string!
    name : string
    code : string
    stack : string
  }
  type Asset = {
      url : asset
      atlas : asset
      sprite : string
      role : string
      category : string
      animations : [string]
      style : string
      variant : string
      dimension : string
      aspect : string
      name : string
      thumbnailUrl : string
    }
  type UncontrolledBattleBoardTilesItem = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    terrain : string
    type : string
    terrainSprite : Asset
    passable : boolean
    movementCost : number
    tileType : string
    elevation : number
    modelUrl : Asset
  }
  type UncontrolledBattleBoardUnitsItem = {
    id : string!
    name : string
    team : "player" | "enemy" | "neutral"
    hp : number!
    maxHp : number!
    atk : number!
    def : number
    position : UncontrolledBattleBoardUnitsItemPosition
    modelUrl : Asset
    unitType : string
    animation : string
    frame : number
  }
  type UncontrolledBattleBoardUnitsItemPosition = {
    x : number!
    y : number!
  }
  type UncontrolledBattleBoardEffectItem = {
    key : string!
    x : number!
    y : number!
    ttl : number!
  }
  type UncontrolledBattleBoardFeaturesItem = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    type : string!
    sprite : Asset
    assetUrl : Asset
    color : string
    elevation : number
  }
  type UncontrolledBattleBoardAssetManifest = {
    terrains : Map string Asset
    units : Map string Asset
    features : Map string Asset
    effects : Map string Asset
    ui : Map string Asset
  }

  entity UncontrolledBattleBoardItem [runtime] {
    id : string!
    units : [UncontrolledBattleBoardUnitsItem]
    selectedUnitId : string = ""
    validMoves : [UncontrolledBattleBoardUnitsItemPosition] = []
    turn : number = 1
    result : "none" | "victory" | "defeat" = none
    title : string
    description : string
    effects : [UncontrolledBattleBoardEffectItem] = []
  }

  trait UncontrolledBattleBoardRender -> @rebindable UncontrolledBattleBoardItem [interaction, instance] {
    initial: playing

    state playing {
      INIT -> playing
        (set @entity.units @config.initialUnits)
        (set @entity.turn 1)
        (set @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.title @config.title)
        (set @entity.description @config.description)
        (set @entity.effects [])
        (set @entity.selectedUnitId "")
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Round", value: @entity.turn, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-round.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-round", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Allies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-allies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-allies", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Enemies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-enemies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-enemies", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f assetUrl), anchor: "ground", width: 1, height: 1 })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (== (object/get @u id) @entity.selectedUnitId))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "ellipse", position: (object/get @u position), radiusX: 0.5, radiusY: 0.2, stroke: "rgba(0,200,255,0.8)", strokeWidth: 3 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u (let ((unitAnim (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation))) (unitFrame (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "walk") (% (object/get @u frame) 2) (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "idle") (% (math/floor (/ (object/get @u frame) 3)) 4) 0)))) { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "ground", width: 0.5, height: 0.5, asset: (if (str/includes (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") (object/merge (object/get @u modelUrl) { url: (str/concat (array/nth (str/split (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat @unitAnim (str/concat "-" (str/concat @unitFrame ".svg"))))) }) (object/get @u modelUrl)) }))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: 0.8, height: 0.12, fill: "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: (* 0.8 (/ (object/get @u hp) (object/get @u maxHp))), height: 0.12, fill: "#22c55e" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @f key)) })) }
          ] } ]
        })

      GAME_END -> complete when (!= @entity.result "none")
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
          overlay: { type: game-menu, title: (if (!= @entity.result "victory") "DEFEAT" "VICTORY"), subtitle: "Battle complete", options: [ { id: "again", label: "Play Again", event: "PLAY_AGAIN", variant: "primary" } ] }
          addons: { type: button, action: PLAY_AGAIN, label: "Play Again", iconAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-restart.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-restart", thumbnailUrl: "" }, variant: primary }
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Round", value: @entity.turn, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-round.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-round", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Allies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-allies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-allies", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Enemies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-enemies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-enemies", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f assetUrl), anchor: "ground", width: 1, height: 1 })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (== (object/get @u id) @entity.selectedUnitId))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "ellipse", position: (object/get @u position), radiusX: 0.5, radiusY: 0.2, stroke: "rgba(0,200,255,0.8)", strokeWidth: 3 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u (let ((unitAnim (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation))) (unitFrame (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "walk") (% (object/get @u frame) 2) (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "idle") (% (math/floor (/ (object/get @u frame) 3)) 4) 0)))) { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "ground", width: 0.5, height: 0.5, asset: (if (str/includes (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") (object/merge (object/get @u modelUrl) { url: (str/concat (array/nth (str/split (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat @unitAnim (str/concat "-" (str/concat @unitFrame ".svg"))))) }) (object/get @u modelUrl)) }))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: 0.8, height: 0.12, fill: "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: (* 0.8 (/ (object/get @u hp) (object/get @u maxHp))), height: 0.12, fill: "#22c55e" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @f key)) })) }
          ] } ]
        })
    }

    state complete {
      PLAY_AGAIN -> playing
        (set @entity.units @config.initialUnits)
        (set @entity.turn 1)
        (set @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.title @config.title)
        (set @entity.description @config.description)
        (set @entity.effects [])
        (set @entity.selectedUnitId "")
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Round", value: @entity.turn, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-round.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-round", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Allies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-allies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-allies", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Enemies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-enemies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-enemies", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f assetUrl), anchor: "ground", width: 1, height: 1 })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (== (object/get @u id) @entity.selectedUnitId))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "ellipse", position: (object/get @u position), radiusX: 0.5, radiusY: 0.2, stroke: "rgba(0,200,255,0.8)", strokeWidth: 3 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u (let ((unitAnim (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation))) (unitFrame (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "walk") (% (object/get @u frame) 2) (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "idle") (% (math/floor (/ (object/get @u frame) 3)) 4) 0)))) { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "ground", width: 0.5, height: 0.5, asset: (if (str/includes (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") (object/merge (object/get @u modelUrl) { url: (str/concat (array/nth (str/split (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat @unitAnim (str/concat "-" (str/concat @unitFrame ".svg"))))) }) (object/get @u modelUrl)) }))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: 0.8, height: 0.12, fill: "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: (* 0.8 (/ (object/get @u hp) (object/get @u maxHp))), height: 0.12, fill: "#22c55e" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @f key)) })) }
          ] } ]
        })
    }

    ticks {
      renderTick every 100ms
        when (== @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.units (array/map @entity.units (fn u (object/merge @u { frame: (+ (object/get @u frame) 1) }))))
        (set @entity.effects (array/filter (array/map @entity.effects (fn e (object/merge @e { ttl: (- (object/get @e ttl) 1) }))) (fn e (> (object/get @e ttl) 0))))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Round", value: @entity.turn, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-round.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-round", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Allies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-allies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-allies", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Enemies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-enemies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-enemies", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f assetUrl), anchor: "ground", width: 1, height: 1 })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (== (object/get @u id) @entity.selectedUnitId))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "ellipse", position: (object/get @u position), radiusX: 0.5, radiusY: 0.2, stroke: "rgba(0,200,255,0.8)", strokeWidth: 3 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u (let ((unitAnim (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation))) (unitFrame (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "walk") (% (object/get @u frame) 2) (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "idle") (% (math/floor (/ (object/get @u frame) 3)) 4) 0)))) { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "ground", width: 0.5, height: 0.5, asset: (if (str/includes (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") (object/merge (object/get @u modelUrl) { url: (str/concat (array/nth (str/split (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat @unitAnim (str/concat "-" (str/concat @unitFrame ".svg"))))) }) (object/get @u modelUrl)) }))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: 0.8, height: 0.12, fill: "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: (* 0.8 (/ (object/get @u hp) (object/get @u maxHp))), height: 0.12, fill: "#22c55e" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @f key)) })) }
          ] } ]
        })

      autoBattleTick every 2s
        when (and (== @entity.result "none") (and (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0))))) 0) (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0))))) 0)))
        (set @entity.units (array/map @entity.units (fn u (if (> @u.hp 0) (object/merge @u { animation: "idle" }) @u))))
        (set @entity.units (array/map @entity.units (fn u (if (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0)) (if (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn e (and (and (== @e.team "enemy") (> @e.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @e position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) 0) (object/merge @u { animation: "attack" }) @u) (if (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0)) (if (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn p (and (and (== @p.team "player") (> @p.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @p position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) 0) (object/merge @u { animation: "attack" }) @u) @u)))))
        (set @entity.units (array/map @entity.units (fn u (if (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0)) (if (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn e (and (and (== @e.team "enemy") (> @e.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @e position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) 0) (object/merge @u { hp: (math/max 0 (- @u.hp (object/get (array/first (array/filter @entity.units (fn e (and (and (== @e.team "enemy") (> @e.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @e position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) atk))), animation: (if (<= (math/max 0 (- @u.hp (object/get (array/first (array/filter @entity.units (fn e (and (and (== @e.team "enemy") (> @e.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @e position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) atk))) 0) "death" "hit") }) @u) @u))))
        (set @entity.units (array/map @entity.units (fn u (if (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0)) (if (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn p (and (and (== @p.team "player") (> @p.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @p position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) 0) (object/merge @u { hp: (math/max 0 (- @u.hp (object/get (array/first (array/filter @entity.units (fn p (and (and (== @p.team "player") (> @p.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @p position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) atk))), animation: (if (<= (math/max 0 (- @u.hp (object/get (array/first (array/filter @entity.units (fn p (and (and (== @p.team "player") (> @p.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @p position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) atk))) 0) "death" "hit") }) @u) @u))))
        (set @entity.units (array/map @entity.units (fn u (if (and (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0)) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn p (and (and (== @p.team "player") (> @p.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @p position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) 0) (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn p (and (== @p.team "player") (> @p.hp 0))))) 0))) (let ((target (array/first (array/filter @entity.units (fn p (and (== @p.team "player") (> @p.hp 0))))))) (object/merge @u { position: { x: (math/clamp (+ (object/get (object/get @u position) x) (math/sign (- (object/get (object/get @target position) x) (object/get (object/get @u position) x)))) 0 4), y: (math/clamp (+ (object/get (object/get @u position) y) (math/sign (- (object/get (object/get @target position) y) (object/get (object/get @u position) y)))) 0 4) }, animation: "walk" })) @u))))
        (set @entity.units (array/map @entity.units (fn u (if (and (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0)) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn e (and (and (== @e.team "enemy") (> @e.hp 0)) (== (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get @e position) (object/get @u position)) 1))))) 0) (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn e (and (== @e.team "enemy") (> @e.hp 0))))) 0))) (let ((target (array/first (array/filter @entity.units (fn e (and (== @e.team "enemy") (> @e.hp 0))))))) (object/merge @u { position: { x: (math/clamp (+ (object/get (object/get @u position) x) (math/sign (- (object/get (object/get @target position) x) (object/get (object/get @u position) x)))) 0 4), y: (math/clamp (+ (object/get (object/get @u position) y) (math/sign (- (object/get (object/get @target position) y) (object/get (object/get @u position) y)))) 0 4) }, animation: "walk" })) @u))))
        (if (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (or (== @u.animation "hit") (== @u.animation "death"))))) 0) (set @entity.effects (array/append @entity.effects { key: "slash", x: (object/get (object/get (array/first (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (or (== @u.animation "hit") (== @u.animation "death"))))) position) x), y: (object/get (object/get (array/first (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (or (== @u.animation "hit") (== @u.animation "death"))))) position) y), ttl: 4 })) null)
        (set @entity.result (if (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0))))) 0) "defeat" (if (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0))))) 0) "victory" "none")))
        (set @entity.turn (+ @entity.turn 1))
        (if (== @entity.result "none") (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Round", value: @entity.turn, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-round.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-round", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Allies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "player") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-allies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-allies", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Enemies", value: (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "enemy") (> @u.hp 0))))), iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-enemies.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: ["static"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-enemies", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: true, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @config.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f assetUrl), anchor: "ground", width: 1, height: 1 })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m y) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (== (object/get @u id) @entity.selectedUnitId))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "ellipse", position: (object/get @u position), radiusX: 0.5, radiusY: 0.2, stroke: "rgba(0,200,255,0.8)", strokeWidth: 3 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u (let ((unitAnim (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation))) (unitFrame (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "walk") (% (object/get @u frame) 2) (if (== (if (<= (object/get @u hp) 0) "death" (object/get @u animation)) "idle") (% (math/floor (/ (object/get @u frame) 3)) 4) 0)))) { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "ground", width: 0.5, height: 0.5, asset: (if (str/includes (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") (object/merge (object/get @u modelUrl) { url: (str/concat (array/nth (str/split (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat @unitAnim (str/concat "-" (str/concat @unitFrame ".svg"))))) }) (object/get @u modelUrl)) }))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: 0.8, height: 0.12, fill: "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.6, width: (* 0.8 (/ (object/get @u hp) (object/get @u maxHp))), height: 0.12, fill: "#22c55e" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.effects (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @f key)) })) }
          ] } ]
        }) null)
        (if (!= @entity.result "none") (emit GAME_END) null)
    }

    emits {
      GAME_END -> external {
        result : string
      }
        @description "Emitted when one side is wiped out; drives the terminal transition"
        @tier "domain"
      PLAY_AGAIN -> external {
        id : string
      }
        @description "playAgainEvent prop — reset + restart the battle"
        @tier "domain"
      TILE_CLICK -> external {
        x : number!
        y : number!
      }
        @description "tileClickEvent prop — emitted when a tile is clicked on the canvas"
        @tier "domain"
      UNIT_CLICK -> external {
        unitId : string!
      }
        @description "unitClickEvent prop — emitted when a unit is clicked on the canvas"
        @tier "domain"
    }

    config {
      title : string = "Auto Battle"
        @label "Title"
        @description "Battle scenario title shown above the board."
        @tier "domain"
      description : string = "Watch the units battle to the last one standing."
        @label "Description"
        @description "Short scenario description."
        @tier "domain"
      initialUnits : [UncontrolledBattleBoardUnitsItem] = [{ id: "u1", name: "Mender", team: "player", hp: 20, maxHp: 20, atk: 5, def: 2, position: { x: 1, y: 2 }, unitType: "mender", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/units/mender.svg", role: "npc", category: "mender", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "mender", thumbnailUrl: "" }, animation: "idle", frame: 0 }, { id: "u2", name: "Shadow Legion", team: "enemy", hp: 15, maxHp: 15, atk: 4, def: 1, position: { x: 3, y: 2 }, unitType: "shadow", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-uncontrolled-battle-board/svg/isometric/units/shadow.svg", role: "npc", category: "shadow", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "shadow", thumbnailUrl: "" }, animation: "idle", frame: 0 }]
        @label "Initial Units"
        @description "Starting unit roster — each needs id, team (player|enemy), hp, atk, position."
        @tier "domain"
